    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261360/extras/cf985a69d17ba2dd4adc8fb341244515.avif?t=1745519209\" data-has-big width=800 height=334 /></span>After cruelly rejecting the love confession of a classmate, you find your soul being transported to another world-- a world where monsters are real...sexy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Madame Desdemona and her ghoulish girls are not pleased with how you treated their witch friend and have decided to put you through a series of trials to better your heart. Complete the challenges of each girl to earn your way home!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261360/extras/08a61126264c6455e3535173f4a42ec2.avif?t=1745519209\" data-has-big width=800 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A minigame collection where you bond with 5 monster girls and get in their panties!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each girl has 5 parts of their heart that you must collect. Win a piece every time you defeat them in their designated minigame, and learn more about the girls in the process! Complete each heart to unlock a steamy sex scene with your spooky babe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> THE MINIGAMES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Phoenix's Finding Frenzy:</strong></u> Help Phoenix locate her lost items!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Stay Away From Jay:</u></strong> Get through the maze while avoiding Jay at all costs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Melodies With Maree:</strong></u> Keep time with Maree's song!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Aggy's Quiz Time Extravaganza:</strong></u> Test your knowledge with Agnes' trivia! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Desdemona's Denouement:</strong></u> Face off with Desdemona in a game of checkers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Mating Meter:</strong></u> Fill the meter and make your girl happy!</p></li></ul>",
